<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>You are not apart from Me,</l><l>This broken world tries to deceive.</l><l>Just believe into your Lord,</l><l>Your seeking heart will be restored in Me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Here I am still asking why</l><l>As moments come and years go by.</l><l>Will I ever come to be</l><l>What You desire or will I flee from You?</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Turn your eyes on Me this day</l><l>And take more time to call and pray;</l><l>We are joined in spirit now,</l><l>This is an everlasting vow from Me.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Lord, when I am looking back,</l><l>All that I see are things I lack.</l><l>Help me cast these doubts aside</l><l>While knowing that Your life resides in me.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Don’t look back! The past is dead,</l><l>You’re with Me now, just look ahead.</l><l>Keep Me in your faithful gaze</l><l>And grow in life through all your days with Me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
